               END-IF.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       REFRESH-MODEL-0068.
               UNSTRING WS-KEY-CHAR DELIMITED BY '/'
                             INTO WS-KEY-CUSTOMER
                                  WS-KEY-POLICY
               END-UNSTRING.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       NORMALISE-REG-NUMBER-0069.
